<div id="urduTextPath">شہزادی فضّہ(ص)/نام ہے نیک نام فضّہ کا</div>

Naam hai nekh naam fizza ka<br>
Aayate hai kalaam fizza ka<br>
Qidmate haq hai kaam fizza ka<br>
Rab se pucho maqaam fiza ka<br>
<br>
Sar se paa tak salaam hai fizza<br>
Wajib ul ehteraam hai fizza<br>
<br>
Wo madeene me aayi thi jis dam<br>
Us pe taari thi bekasi ka alam<br>
Tha aseeri ka us ko gham paiham<br>
Us pe barsa nabi ka abre karam<br>
<br>
Naam us ka rasool ne rakhha<br>
Apne ghar me batool ne rakkha<br>
<br>
Us ko qismat ali ke ghar laayi<br>
Chod kar wo shahinshaahi aayi<br>
Us se meraaj e haq rasi paayi<br>
Fatima ki kaneez kehlaayi<br>
<br>
Us ka rutba buland o baala hai<br>
Chaar imamo ko us ne paala hai<br>
<br>
Saltanat chod kar wo aayi thi<br>
Uf re fizza ki door andeshi<br>
Tarbiyat uski fatima ne jo ki<br>
Ho ke seefal chamak uthi chaandi<br>
<br>
Qaak se noor bangayi fizza<br>
Sar ta paa hoor ban gayi fizza<br>
<br>
Apni fitrat ko haq mizaaj kiya<br>
Ghar me zehra ke kaam kaaj kiya<br>
Hubbe zainab ko sar ka taaj kiya<br>
Deen ki saltanat me raaj kiya<br>
<br>
Haq ki nazrou me ba weqaar bani<br>
Wo kaneezi me naa jawaar bani<br>
<br>
Jab jaha'n se guzar gayi zehra<br>
Tha ajab haal gham se bachou ka<br>
Uth gaya maa ka sar se jab saaya<br>
Ghamzadou ko tha aasra tera<br>
<br>
Aise aalam me bhi rafaaqat thi<br>
Tu ne maa ki tarha se qidmat ki<br>
<br>
umme kulsoom aur zainab ki<br>
Paasbaani me teri umr kati<br>
Dil se hasnain par nisaar huwi<br>
Sab ko ghere thi maamta teri<br>
<br>
Teri ulfat ka rang anokha hai<br>
Maa ki ankhou se sabko dekha hai<br>
<br>
Karti thi ghar ka roz aana<br>
Ek din fizza ek din zehra<br>
Yaa bano ka aur kaneezi ka<br>
Ghar me zehra ke jo nahi paaya<br>
<br>
Dil se hairaan ho gayi fizza<br>
Ghar pe qurbaan ho gayi fizza<br>
<br>
Roniya tu ne bhi jo di fizza <br>
Tujh ko bhi rab ne haq diya tera<br>
Zikr tera bhi shukriya me kiya<br>
Hal ata me bhi hai tera qissa<br>
<br>
Teri qairaat qair kaamil hai<br>
Sath tu panjetan ke shaamil hai<br>
<br>
Tujh pe toote sitam jo baade nabi<br>
Fatima ki ajab haalat thi<br>
Huwi jis dam wafaat mohsin ki<br>
Tu ne ki fatima ki diljoyi<br>
<br>
Gham ke toofa'n ko tune taala hai<br>
Tu ne shehzadi ko sambhala hai<br>
<br>
Ranj o gham ke safar me sath rahi<br>
Raah e qoufo qatar me sath rahi<br>
Pyaas ki rehguzar me saath rahi<br>
Tashnagi ke nagar me sath rahi<br>
<br>
Karne qidmat ka haq ada pohanchi<br>
Sath zainab ke karbala pohanchi<br>
<br>
Fatima ka ujad ta ghar dekha<br>
Jhule wale ko qoo'n me tar dekha<br>
Zaqmi akbar ka bhi jigar dekha<br>
Noke naiza pe sheh ka sar dekha<br>
<br>
Tu shahe mashraqain ko royi <br>
Karbala me hussain ko royi<br>
<br>
Aye kaneeze batool nekh sifaat <br>
Ranj o gham se mili na tujh ko behal <br>
Sadme tu ne uthaye hai din raat <br>
Shamil e karbala hai teri wafat<br>
<br>
Rutba maa ka diya hai zainab ne <br>
Tujh ko amma kaha hai zainab ne<br>
<br>
Seh ke ranjo mehan jahaa'n se gayi<br>
Zindagi bhar tu sogwaar rahi<br>
Tanha tuj pe har bala ki huwi <br>
Khoo'n rulaati hai bekasi teri<br>
<br>
Ashk ankhou me bharke laye hai<br>
Sab Azadar rone aaye hai